  "description": "Moving into her dream apartment was supposed to be a relief for Yuri, but choosing a moving company proved to be a total headache. Desperate, she takes a recommendation from her assistant manager and books a service that promises to handle everything. But when the movers arrive, Yuri realizes she accidentally selected the premium package. These gorgeous men aren’t just here to unpack boxes - they’re ready to deliver an unforgettable, full-service experience that caters to her every desire. Moving day just got a lot more hands-on.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
